{"4434820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WorldLoop", "steam_appid": 4434820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WorldLoop is a story-driven RPG about cycles, sacrifice, and irreversible choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world trapped in endless rebirth, every victory carries a hidden cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities burn. Kingdoms fall. Memories fade.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.poster.avif?t=1780150825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.webm?t=1780150825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.mp4?t=1780150825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a wanderer who returns again and again—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >not to save the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but to understand what must be lost to keep it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore collapsing lands, face ancient threats, and uncover the truth behind the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth. Cost. Destroy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WorldLoop is a story-driven RPG about cycles, sacrifice, and irreversible choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world trapped in endless rebirth, every victory carries a hidden cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities burn. Kingdoms fall. Memories fade.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.poster.avif?t=1780150825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.webm?t=1780150825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/extras/e5a76b3afd9991b7578d4ca9c0ffb1e7.mp4?t=1780150825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a wanderer who returns again and again—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >not to save the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but to understand what must be lost to keep it alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore collapsing lands, face ancient threats, and uncover the truth behind the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth. Cost. Destroy.</p>", "short_description": "WorldLoop is a story-driven RPG about cycles, sacrifice, and irreversible choices.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/7238a44b49409937669728680ce5bb87d64942ee/header.jpg?t=1780150825", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/841f37be89b580043b774e42783abebbf264f36c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780150825", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434820/841f37be89b580043b774e42783abebbf264f36c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780150825", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Process